[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 123 A trip",
    "start": 0.71,
    "end": 4.872,
    "zh": "第123课 澳大利亚之行",
    "zh_hant": "第123課 澳大利亞之行"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "to Australia",
    "start": 4.632,
    "end": 6.313,
    "zh": "去澳大利亚",
    "zh_hant": "去澳大利亞"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 7.354,
    "end": 10.395,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 10.155,
    "end": 12.036,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Who is the man with the beard?",
    "start": 12.896,
    "end": 15.858,
    "zh": "那个留胡子的人是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "那個留鬍子的人是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Look, Scott.",
    "start": 17.839,
    "end": 19.199,
    "zh": "看，斯科特。",
    "zh_hant": "看，斯科特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "This is a photograph I took",
    "start": 20.0,
    "end": 23.141,
    "zh": "这是我拍的一张照片",
    "zh_hant": "這是我拍的一張照片"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "during my trip to Australia.",
    "start": 22.921,
    "end": 25.883,
    "zh": "在我去澳大利亚的旅途中拍的。",
    "zh_hant": "在我去澳大利亞的旅途中拍的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Let me see it, Mike.",
    "start": 26.643,
    "end": 28.784,
    "zh": "让我看看，迈克。",
    "zh_hant": "讓我看看，邁克。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "This is a good photograph.",
    "start": 29.205,
    "end": 31.726,
    "zh": "这张照片拍得很好。",
    "zh_hant": "這張照片拍得很好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Who are these people?",
    "start": 31.926,
    "end": 33.967,
    "zh": "这些人是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "這些人是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "They're people I met during the trip.",
    "start": 35.027,
    "end": 38.429,
    "zh": "他们是我旅途中遇到的人。",
    "zh_hant": "他們是我旅途中遇到的人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "That's the ship we travelled on.",
    "start": 39.49,
    "end": 41.971,
    "zh": "那就是我们乘坐的船。",
    "zh_hant": "那就是我們乘坐的船。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "What a beautiful ship!",
    "start": 42.332,
    "end": 44.612,
    "zh": "多漂亮的船啊！",
    "zh_hant": "多漂亮的船啊！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Who's this?",
    "start": 44.953,
    "end": 46.333,
    "zh": "这是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "這是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "That's the man I told you about.",
    "start": 47.114,
    "end": 50.095,
    "zh": "那是我跟你提过的那个人。",
    "zh_hant": "那是我跟你提過的那個人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Remember?",
    "start": 50.156,
    "end": 51.216,
    "zh": "记得吗？",
    "zh_hant": "記得嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Ah yes.",
    "start": 51.596,
    "end": 52.977,
    "zh": "啊，是的。",
    "zh_hant": "啊，是的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "The one who offered you a job in Australia.",
    "start": 53.017,
    "end": 56.979,
    "zh": "就是在澳大利亚给你工作机会的那个人。",
    "zh_hant": "就是在澳大利亞給你工作機會的那個人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 57.339,
    "end": 58.62,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Who's this?",
    "start": 58.88,
    "end": 60.22,
    "zh": "这是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "這是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Guess!",
    "start": 60.541,
    "end": 61.501,
    "zh": "猜猜看！",
    "zh_hant": "猜猜看！"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "It's not you, is it?",
    "start": 61.741,
    "end": 64.102,
    "zh": "这不是你，对吧？",
    "zh_hant": "這不是你，對吧？"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 64.063,
    "end": 65.663,
    "zh": "对。",
    "zh_hant": "對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "I grew a beard during the trip,",
    "start": 66.704,
    "end": 69.345,
    "zh": "我在旅途中留了胡子，",
    "zh_hant": "我在旅途中留了鬍子，"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "but I shaved it off when I came home.",
    "start": 69.706,
    "end": 73.427,
    "zh": "但回家时剃掉了。",
    "zh_hant": "但回家時剃掉了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "Why did you shave it off?",
    "start": 73.487,
    "end": 75.828,
    "zh": "你为什么剃掉它？",
    "zh_hant": "你為什麼剃掉它？"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "My wife didn't like it!",
    "start": 76.149,
    "end": 78.61,
    "zh": "我妻子不喜欢！",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子不喜歡！"
  }
]
